{"id":"fc27afe7-f60a-4035-8411-14970363e9f6","type":"https://serlo.org/editor","variant":"serlo-org","domainOrigin":"serlo.org","version":2,"editorVersion":"0.22.0","dateModified":"2025-02-26T18:26:16.616Z","document":{"plugin":"exerciseGroup","state":{"content":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"multimedia","state":{"explanation":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Es ist Sommer und du kaufst ein Eis. Du erinnerst Dich, dass bei Eispackungen im Supermarkt die Menge an Eis in Litern angegeben ist. Das bringt Dich dazu, das Volumen in deiner Eistüte bestimmen zu wollen!"}]}],"id":"d96e6590-fa7e-46af-b5ac-2283217c8865"}],"id":"600e6b46-2b20-4e72-993e-1b4fb2fb4668"},"multimedia":{"plugin":"image","state":{"src":"http://pixabay.com/static/uploads/photo/2014/08/19/19/48/ice-cream-cone-421855_640.jpg","alt":"Eistüte mit Hand","caption":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"caf893ef-dc40-4a73-9967-bd245ca70f69"}},"id":"a2252d0c-866f-489e-8c44-1b59cc6d8927"},"illustrating":true,"width":50},"id":"96262581-c0ba-4010-a5bf-40912985f521"}],"id":"10de2f92-2180-4ff6-84ce-88f64063941f"},"exercises":[{"plugin":"exercise","state":{"content":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Nach Deiner Messung ist die Eistüte "},{"type":"math","src":"16\,\text{cm}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"16\,\text{cm}"}]},{"text":" hoch und die Öffnung hat einen Durchmesser von "},{"type":"math","src":"6\,\text{cm}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"6\,\text{cm}"}]},{"text":". Wie viel Liter Eis befinden sich darin?"}]}],"id":"03eb4c00-4327-4f78-a6ec-5dfe80056f22"}],"id":"af69895d-1ab7-4dae-a74e-82d05131692e"},"solution":{"plugin":"solution","state":{"strategy":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"c902823d-07c6-437d-bbf9-64537e36f695"},"steps":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"h","level":3,"children":[{"text":"Vorüberlegungen"}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Wenn Du den Rand deiner Eistüte betrachtest erkennst du einen Kreis. Die Spitze der Eistüte denkst Du dir als einen Punkt. Bei deiner Eistüte handelt es sich um einen Kegel."}]},{"type":"h","level":3,"children":[{"text":"Volumen eines Kegels"}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Du benötigst den Radius "},{"type":"math","src":"r","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"r"}]},{"text":" und die Höhe "},{"type":"math","src":"h","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"h"}]},{"text":" des Kegels. Die Höhe ist direkt gegeben und der Radius ist der halbe Durchmesser:"}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Berechne damit nun das Volumen."}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"h","level":3,"children":[{"text":"Umrechnen "}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Für das "},{"type":"a","href":"https://de.serlo.org/mathe/zahlen-gr%C3%B6%C3%9Fen/gr%C3%B6%C3%9Fen-einheiten/umrechnen-einheiten","children":[{"text":"Umrechnen von Litern"}]},{"text":" gilt "},{"type":"math","src":"1\,\text{l} = 1 \,\text{dm}^3","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"1\,\text{l} = 1 \,\text{dm}^3"}]},{"text":" und "},{"type":"math","src":"1\,\text{dm}^3 = 1000\,\text{cm}^3","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"1\,\text{dm}^3 = 1000\,\text{cm}^3"}]},{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Beides zusammen ergibt"}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""},{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{lcl}
1\,\text{l} &=& 1000\,\text{cm}^3\\ 
\dfrac{1}{1000} \,\text{l} &=& 1 \,\text{cm}^3
\end{array}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Rechne damit das Volumen der Eistüte um."}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"math","src":"V_{Eistüte}\approx 150,8 \,\text{cm}^3 = \dfrac{150,8}{1000} \,\text{l} = 0,1508 \,\text{l} \approx 0,15 \,\text{l}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":"V_{Eistüte}\approx 150,8 \,\text{cm}^3 = \dfrac{150,8}{1000} \,\text{l} = 0,1508 \,\text{l} \approx 0,15 \,\text{l}"}]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"In die Eistüte passen also etwa "},{"type":"math","src":"0,15","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"0,15"}]},{"text":" Liter Eis."}]}],"id":"2eafeab0-d1f9-42bf-9718-f88d8168542a"}],"id":"2b3a0ab2-f776-4693-94cb-6e728c041e88"},"prerequisite":{"id":"1561","title":"Kegel"}},"id":"2b384d14-6ad2-458e-b583-76240464c7cb"}},"id":"293586-exercise-child"},{"plugin":"exercise","state":{"content":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Wie groß müsste Deine Eistüte sein, um dasselbe Volumen fassen zu können wie eine Packung mit "},{"type":"math","src":"1","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"1"}]},{"text":" Liter Eis?"}]}],"id":"3a5d1718-e982-4a18-b4ac-870801a16b82"}],"id":"d61ae3dc-5bd4-4853-bf95-891b47d47741"},"solution":{"plugin":"solution","state":{"strategy":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"029a1bd0-0a12-4e85-a5e7-912d26dcfa4e"},"steps":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"h","level":3,"children":[{"text":"Vorüberlegungen"}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Du kannst die Eistüte auf verschiedene Arten vergrößern. Du kannst"}]},{"type":"unordered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"list-item-child","children":[{"text":"das Verhältnis von "},{"type":"math","src":"r","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"r"}]},{"text":" und "},{"type":"math","src":"h","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"h"}]},{"text":" so belassen wie bei deiner ursprünglichen Eistüte. Dabei würdest du "},{"type":"math","src":"r","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"r"}]},{"text":" und "},{"type":"math","src":"h","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"h"}]},{"text":" mit dem gleichen Faktor "},{"type":"math","src":"a","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"a"}]},{"text":" multiplizieren, also "},{"type":"math","src":"r","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"r"}]},{"text":" durch "},{"type":"math","src":"a\cdot r","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"a\cdot r"}]},{"text":" und "},{"type":"math","src":"h","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"h"}]},{"text":" durch "},{"type":"math","src":"a \cdot h","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"a \cdot h"}]},{"text":" ersetzen."}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"list-item-child","children":[{"text":"das Verhältnis von "},{"type":"math","src":"r","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"r"}]},{"text":" und "},{"type":"math","src":"h","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"h"}]},{"text":" verändern und die Form deiner Eistüte verzerren. Zum Beispiel könntest du den dreifachen Radius "},{"type":"math","src":"3r","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"3r"}]},{"text":" und die halbe Höhe "},{"type":"math","src":"\dfrac{h}{2}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"\dfrac{h}{2}"}]},{"text":" nehmen."}]}]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Nimm hier an, dass du die ursprüngliche Form der Eistüte beibehalten möchtest."}]},{"type":"h","level":3,"children":[{"text":"Aufstellen einer Gleichung"}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Du kannst bereits das Volumen einer Eistüte berechnen, wenn du "},{"type":"math","src":"r","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"r"}]},{"text":" und "},{"type":"math","src":"h","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"h"}]},{"text":" kennst."}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Nun ist der Radius und die Höhe der größeren Eistüte aber unbekannt. Du multiplizierst Höhe und Radius mit einer Zahl "},{"type":"math","src":"a","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"a"}]},{"text":", die du noch nicht kennst."}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Du musst "},{"type":"math","src":"a","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"a"}]},{"text":" so wählen, dass das Volumen genau "},{"type":"math","src":"1\,\text{l} = 1000\,\text{cm}^3","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"1\,\text{l} = 1000\,\text{cm}^3"}]},{"text":" ist, was zu folgender Gleichung führt:"}]},{"type":"h","level":3,"children":[{"text":"Lösen einer Gleichung mit einer Unbekannten"}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""},{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcll}\dfrac{1}{3} \pi (ar)^2 (ah) & = & 1000 \,\text{cm}^3 & \left|\quad \text{Vereinfache die linke Seite}\right. \\\dfrac{\pi}{3} r^2h \cdot a^3 & = & 1000 \,\text{cm}^3 & \left| :(\dfrac{\pi}{3} rh) \right. \\a^3 & = & \dfrac{3000 \, \text{cm}^3}{\pi r^2h}  & \left| \quad\ \text{Werte aus Teil 1 einsetzen} \right. \\a^3 & = & \dfrac{3000\, \text{cm}^3}{\pi\cdot (3\,\mathrm{cm})^2\cdot 16\, \mathrm{cm}} & \\a^3 & \approx & 6,63 & \left|\sqrt[3]{}\right. \\a & \approx & 1,88&\end{array}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Also müsstest du dir deine Eiswaffel mit einem Volumen von "},{"type":"math","src":"0,15","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"0,15"}]},{"text":" Litern etwas weniger als doppelt so breit und hoch vorstellen, um das Volumen auf "},{"type":"math","src":"1","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"1"}]},{"text":" Liter zu erhöhen!"}]}],"id":"7f10466c-4d85-433a-9181-b10f44d8319d"}],"id":"2411f155-01f5-4d38-a866-780e0f09490c"},"prerequisite":{"id":"1561","title":"Kegel"}},"id":"f47497a1-edb9-4d5c-a142-e1b92054e828"}},"id":"293588-exercise-child"}]},"id":"dd7075d5-6303-41da-a684-c02a63e2e095"}}
